  "goodToKnow": "Die Besonnenheit is calm, thoughtful judgement under pressure. The adjective besonnen (level-headed) looks like it has to do with the sun (Sonne), but it comes from sich besinnen, to reflect or collect your thoughts. Politicians love the phrase zur Besonnenheit aufrufen (to call for calm) after shocking events. Opposite: die Hektik, die Panik. It has no plural."
